{"id":"2aa45838691ad3c6","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-ce-complexity-dips.md","title":"Unbounded Deficiency below Barzdins Bounds","display":"thm-ce-complexity-dips — Unbounded Deficiency below Barzdins Bounds","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-ce-complexity-dips","aliases":["43-thm-ce-complexity-dips"],"display":"thm-ce-complexity-dips — Unbounded Deficiency below Barzdins Bounds","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-kolm]]","[[43-df-condplainkolm]]","[[43-df-pair-coding]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 19.1.2","source_printed_pages":"570","source_pdf_pages":"590","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-ce-complexity-dips"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-ce-complexity-dips</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ce-complexity-dips — Unbounded Deficiency below Barzdins Bounds"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e79ea45002ccf795\" href=\"?note=e79ea45002ccf795\" title=\"43-df-condplainkolm\">43-df-condplainkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 19.1.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"570"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"590"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\)</span>；普通复杂度及条件版本见直接依赖。</p>\n<p>本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e79ea45002ccf795\" href=\"?note=e79ea45002ccf795\" title=\"43-df-condplainkolm\">43-df-condplainkolm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall d,N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j\\ge\\max\\{N,2\\}\\}\\;C(A\\upharpoonright n\\mid n)&lt;\\log_2n-d.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall d,N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j\\ge\\max\\{N,2\\}\\}\\;C(A\\upharpoonright n\\mid n)&lt;\\log_2n-d.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall d,N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j\\ge\\max\\{N,2\\}\\}\\;C(A\\upharpoonright n)&lt;2\\log_2n-d.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall d,N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j\\ge\\max\\{N,2\\}\\}\\;C(A\\upharpoonright n)&lt;2\\log_2n-d.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 无限，取初始段元素数恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^k\">\\(2^k\\)</span> 的长度，计数只需说明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>，产生任意大亏损；有限集由其有限信息硬编码，结论同样成立。增加无限性量词只将有限小长度影响吸收，不加强本质内容。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 19.1.2；印刷页 570，PDF 页 590。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-condplainkolm","status":"resolved","id":"e79ea45002ccf795","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-condplainkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pair-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-condplainkolm]]、[[43-df-pair-coding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-condplainkolm]]、[[43-df-pair-coding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-condplainkolm","status":"resolved","id":"e79ea45002ccf795","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-condplainkolm]]、[[43-df-pair-coding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-condplainkolm]]、[[43-df-pair-coding]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall d,N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j\\ge\\max\\{N,2\\}\\}\\;C(A\\upharpoonright n\\mid n)<\\log_2n-d.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall d,N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j\\ge\\max\\{N,2\\}\\}\\;C(A\\upharpoonright n)<2\\log_2n-d.","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"2^k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":1713,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-479","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-ce-complexity-dips]] — Unbounded Deficiency below Barzdins Bounds"}],"outgoing":["6c0559518cd32104","a0589ee7a1cc12e8","e79ea45002ccf795","e039afac1517f3d7"]}